  <tr>
    <td bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P><STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>'s official website, <A href="http://www.madonna.com" target=_blank>Madonna.com</A>, has just changed its homepage again. This time is the turn of an amazing photograph from the set of <STRONG>"Take A Bow"</STRONG> video.</P>
<P><EM><STRONG>Errata Corridge:</STRONG> Our readers made us notice that this photo comes from the <STRONG>VH1&nbsp;commercial</STRONG> Madonna did at the time the <STRONG>Take A Bow</STRONG> video was filmed. So Madonna has to dressed this way twice.</EM></P>
<P align=center><A href="/images/2005/madonna_com18feb.jpg" target=_blank><IMG alt="click to enlarge" src="/images/2005/madonna_com18feb_small.jpg" border=0></A></P>
</font></div>
