	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P>Our friends at <STRONG>Warner Music Italy</STRONG> informed us that at the moment the release month for the <STRONG>DVD</STRONG> of the <STRONG>re-Invention Tour</STRONG> is <STRONG>November 2005</STRONG>. </P>
