  <tr>
    <td bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P>Today, <STRONG>40TV</STRONG> (a Spanish tv music channel)&nbsp;aired a special about <STRONG>St. Valentine’s Day</STRONG>. They showed a lot of classic love music videos and of course they included one from<STRONG> Madonna</STRONG>. </P>
